{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliria \u2013 An Infinite 3D Sandbox Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>Deliria</strong>, an infinite 3D sandbox where the world bends to your will\u2014and nothing is made of cubes. Dig, destroy, and reshape landscapes, carve sprawling underground caves, and explore endless biomes teeming with secrets, treasures, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you delve into shadowy depths to uncover rare resources and craft powerful weapons, tools, and gear? Or rise to face 8 epic bosses and hundreds of unique enemies that roam the surface and caverns? Each battle tests your <strong>advanced hack-and-slash combat skills</strong> as enemies anticipate your moves and strike where you plan to attack next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perhaps your ambition lies elsewhere: constructing sprawling cities, fortresses, or elaborate arenas to unleash chaos in <strong>PvP</strong>, <strong>co-op</strong>, or your own creative experiments. Chain combos to earn <strong>style points</strong>, filling meters that reward you with <strong>rare drops and superior loot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the world like never before: <strong>arm NPCs with weapons and armor and send them into battle, ride mounts, and soar through the skies with the ability to fly</strong>. Track how long you survive and how many days you endure in the wild, or switch to <strong>creative mode</strong> to build arenas where bosses and mobs clash for your entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is yours. Play solo, explore with friends, or bend the world to your imagination in creative mode. With over <strong>500 items</strong> to collect, craft, and master, and <strong>20+ original soundtracks</strong> to accompany your journey, no two adventures in Deliria are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite 3D Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Dig, build, and destroy freely in a seamless, cube-free world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and Enemies</strong> \u2013 Face 8 epic bosses and hundreds of unique enemies across diverse biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong> \u2013 Traverse endless landscapes, hidden caves, and underground biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build cities, arenas, command epic battles, arm NPCs, or watch bosses and mobs fight in arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete or cooperate with friends in PvP and co-op modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mounts and Flight</strong> \u2013 Ride mounts and fly to explore and battle in entirely new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Tracking</strong> \u2013 Keep track of how long and how many days you survive in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Gear</strong> \u2013 Gather resources and craft over 500 items to survive, explore, and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 A sweeping, heroic orchestral score by Claire Noelle accompanies every step of your journey. Bold, tragic, and full of energy, the music underscores both the beauty and danger of a world you shape, conquer, and explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Deliria</strong>, the world is alive, dangerous, and infinite. Forge your path, conquer challenges, and leave your mark on a world that is limited only by your imagination.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725650?t=1772327785","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725650?t=1772327785","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725