ng> as enemies anticipate your moves and strike where you plan to attack next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perhaps your ambition lies elsewhere: constructing sprawling cities, fortresses, or elaborate arenas to unleash chaos in <strong>PvP</strong>, <strong>co-op</strong>, or your own creative experiments. Chain combos to earn <strong>style points</strong>, filling meters that reward you with <strong>rare drops and superior loot</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of the world like never before: <strong>arm NPCs with weapons and armor and send them into battle, ride mounts, and soar through the skies with the ability to fly</strong>. Track how long you survive and how many days you endure in the wild, or switch to <strong>creative mode</strong> to build arenas where bosses and mobs clash for your entertainment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is yours. Play solo, explore with friends, or bend the world to your imagination in creative mode. With over <strong>500 items</strong> to collect, craft, and master, and <strong>20+ original soundtracks</strong> to accompany your journey, no two adventures in Deliria are ever the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite 3D Sandbox</strong> \u2013 Dig, build, and destroy freely in a seamless, cube-free world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses and Enemies</strong> \u2013 Face 8 epic bosses and hundreds of unique enemies across diverse biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Discovery</strong> \u2013 Traverse endless landscapes, hidden caves, and underground biomes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom</strong> \u2013 Build cities, arenas, command epic battles, arm NPCs, or watch bosses and mobs fight in arenas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Compete or cooperate with friends in PvP and co-op modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mounts and Flight</strong> \u2013 Ride mounts and fly to explore and battle in entirely new ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Tracking</strong> \u2013 Keep track of how long and how many days you survive in your adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and Gear</strong> \u2013 Gather resources and craft over 500 items to survive, explore, and conquer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 A sweeping, heroic orchestral score by Claire Noelle accompanies every step of your journey. Bold, tragic, and full of energy, the music underscores both the beauty and danger of a world you shape, conquer, and explore.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Deliria</strong>, the world is alive, dangerous, and infinite. Forge your path, conquer challenges, and leave your mark on a world that is limited only by your imagination.</p>","developers":["Linesway"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725650/2096c6c5ca795f611484b87e34992aa1b45fdd95/header.jpg?t=1772327785","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 4.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 14.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla